{"version":1,"content":"<p>知情人士透露，泛美衞生組織已撤銷美國的麻疹消除認證。數十年來美國一直控制住這種可通過疫苗預防的疾病，此次認證被撤銷是一次重大反轉。依託大規模免疫接種行動，以及一項為數百萬兒童免費提供疫苗的項目，美國於2000年取得麻疹消除認證。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586370.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.175644+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:53:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"1e0c0c174496890297e30d131a49e6368e7115b425cafca30e0ed90038174ca2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}